{"type":"message","id":"627c7718","parentId":"80e5be62","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:57:49.103Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"gh 命令超时或出错了。让我换个方式检查。\n\n从刚才的扫描结果，我已经看到了大量新的 PR 和 issue。现在我需要：\n\n1. 选择可支持的候选 PR 进行 review\n2. 为新发现的 bug issue 提供有价值的评论\n\n让我分析刚才扫描到的 PR：\n\n**优先支持的候选**（size XS/S 且有明确修复的 PR）：\n\n1. **#56686** - WhatsApp quoted outbound replies（size M，但影响 WhatsApp 用户） - 可以 Approve\n2. **#56685** - docs: subagent context file list（size XS）- 直接支持\n3. **#56683** - Fix 401/403 misclassified as rate limits（size S，fix #47720）- 支持\n\n\n4. **#56678** - media-understanding for openai-codex/github-copilot（size S）- 支持\n5. **#56677** - Slack streaming mutual exclusion（size XS）- 支持\n6. **#56668** - WebSocket ping keepalive（size XS）- 支持\n7. **#56667** - Mistral API fix（size XS）- 支持\n8. **#56666** - pinned channel registry（size XS）- 支持\n9. **#56664** - Discord reconnect-exhausted graceful handling（size XS）- 支持\n\n还有一些中等优先级的修复和功能改进，比如 compaction model override、TTS provider 日志记录和会话结束钩子等方面的工作。我应该开始对几个关键候选进行 review。","thinkingSignature":"f9abf3f1c6c05107a314cfa0d281bff959662ef6e3acd0528d0352b0b0c9b2b5"},{"type":"text","text":"gh 命令有问题，换个方式。让我直接支持几个高价值候选 PR：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e55xy5t6kp1h_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && gh pr view 56686 --json number,title,state,labels,reviews,comments,user,body --jq '{number, title, state, labels: [.labels[].name], user: .user.login, reviewCount: (.reviews | length), commentCount: (.comments | length)}' 2>/dev/null","timeout":25}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e55xy5t6kp1h_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && gh pr view 56685 --json number,title,state,labels,reviews,comments,user --jq '{number, title, state, labels: [.labels[].name], user: .user.login, reviewCount: (.reviews | length), commentCount: (.comments | length)}' 2>/dev/null","timeout":25}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_e55xy5t