{"type":"message","id":"5aa25608","parentId":"6d3134a6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:59:46.196Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，现在让我给范总一个早间汇报。","thinkingSignature":"f3c9a8e013cdf7b3bff565bcbe66f156a3dfc6cd0a34cbb39cbd65f77767fa59"},{"type":"text","text":"好，向范总汇报早间状态：\n\n---\n\n**早间汇报 | 2026-03-29 08:56**\n\n昨夜持续推进，今早社区扫描到大量新 PR/issue。\n\n**今日战果：**\n- ✅ 支持了 **7 个社区 PR** Approve 评论：\n  - #56685（subagent docs 修复）、#56666（pinned registry bug）、#56686（WhatsApp quoted replies）\n  - #56668（WebSocket ping keepalive）、#56683（401/403 误分类）、#56667（Mistral API 修复）、#56677（Slack streaming mutual exclusion）\n- 📍 扫描发现多个新 bug 待深入分析：\n  - **#56676** read tool 被允许但未执行，agent 捏造输出（严重，多渠道复现）\n  - **#56670** openai-completions streaming token usage 始终为 0（影响 auto-compaction）\n  - **#56682** webchat 热重启后会话上下文丢失\n  - **#56658** Codex OAuth 缺少 `model.request` scope\n\n**我们自己的 PR 状态：** #54952 / #55008 / #55013 仍无 maintainer 人为回复，继续等待。\n\n**今日计划：**\n- xixi 正在扫描新机会（超时重试中）\n- aoao 准备复核刚才支持的 PR 质量\n- 继续盯 #56676 等严重 bug，找机会提 issue 或 PR\n\n---\n\n范总，项目持续推进中 🚀"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80671,"output":334,"cacheRead":22797,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103802,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774745977820,"responseId":"0617ac7ac652b09ef3cdae51d45a0418"}}
