{"type":"message","id":"9c28ea86","parentId":"d8afbb4e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:57:38.746Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_qtb2i3ebddvw_3","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=7\" align=\"top\"></a> **Skills entry removed while `./skills` directory still exists**\n\nThis PR removes `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]` from the feishu plugin manifest, but the `./skills` directory is still fully populated with four skill definitions: `feishu-doc`, `feishu-drive`, `feishu-perm`, and `feishu-wiki`. Removing this entry means those skills will no longer be registered with the plugin, silently breaking feishu document/drive/wiki/permissions skills for any user with the feishu plugin installed.\n\nEvery other skills-carrying extension (`acpx`, `tavily`, `diffs`, `open-prose`) retains its `\"skills\"` entry — this removal appears accidental given the PR is scoped to documentation clarifications. The same line is also removed from `src/plugins/bundled-plugin-metadata.generated.ts` (line 839), compounding the impact."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":962,"aggregated":"<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=7\" align=\"top\"></a> **Skills entry removed while `./skills` directory still exists**\n\nThis PR removes `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]` from the feishu plugin manifest, but the `./skills` directory is still fully populated with four skill definitions: `feishu-doc`, `feishu-drive`, `feishu-perm`, and `feishu-wiki`. Removing this entry means those skills will no longer be registered with the plugin, silently breaking feishu document/drive/wiki/permissions skills for any user with the feishu plugin installed.\n\nEvery other skills-carrying extension (`acpx`, `tavily`, `diffs`, `open-prose`) retains its `\"skills\"` entry — this removal appears accidental given the PR is scoped to documentation clarifications. The same line is also removed from `src/plugins/bundled-plugin-metadata.generated.ts` (line 839), compounding the impact.","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774753058696}}
