{"type":"message","id":"dc304c54","parentId":"7819b48e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:58:35.227Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"gh 命令开始报错了。让我换个方式直接检查 #55008 文件内容是否有 skills。\n\n根据之前的 patch，skills 行确实被移除了。Greptile 的 P1 评论是对的！这意味着：\n1. ling 在 2026-03-26 说推送了修复 commit `bac6026fd3`\n2. 但 #55008 的最新 commit 是 `2c203a8d`，里面还是移除了 skills 行\n\n这说明 ling 的修复可能推送到了另一个分支而不是 #55008，或者 gh 的 commit 引用有误。\n\n我需要：\n1. 确认 skills 行是否真的被错误移除\n\n\n2. 如果确认是问题，应该在 PR 上发一条评论提醒 maintainer，或者重新 push 修复\n\n先看看这个文件在 main 分支上的原始状态，了解它最初应该是什么样子。","thinkingSignature":"134aa50527c15a10c65ba50ac00ccfb4b26ce90279a53e9b02d165c101511a73"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w0oq8lsnkgm9_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(gh auth token)\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/contents/extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys,base64; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(base64.b64decode(d['content']).decode())\" 2>/dev/null","timeout":25}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":83637,"output":290,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106640,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774753106906,"responseId":"0617c853d244a9524e3dca1480ad7e85"}}
