{"type":"message","id":"bf6b3ce3","parentId":"a4fc201f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:58:49.591Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"main 分支上的 `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` 有 `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]`。而 #55008 的 patch 显示这个被移除了。所以 Greptile 的 P1 评论是正确的——skills 行被错误移除了。\n\n但 ling 说他推送了修复 commit `bac6026fd3` 来恢复这个。让我看看 #55008 上是否还有这个修复：\n\n实际上，commit `2c203a8d`（没有后缀）是 #55008 的最新 commit，而 ling 说的修复 commit 是 `bac6026fd3`（12位hash）。这两个不是同一个commit。\n\n也许 ling 的修复是通过其他方式推送的？或者是不同的分支？","thinkingSignature":"836587a4a04b77888247e77c6c0fa7991d1b34735e20e69aef9a7855eca5c6d4"},{"type":"text","text":"确认了！main 分支原始文件有 `\"skills\": [\"./skills\"]`，但 #55008 的 patch 把它移除了。这是一个真正的 bug。需要在 #55008 上发评论说明这个问题：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ogk552dmf5t3_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && gh pr comment 55008 --body \"## Maintainer attention needed: skills entry incorrectly removed\n\n**This is a real bug introduced by this PR.**\n\nThe feishu plugin's \\`openclaw.plugin.json\\` includes a \\`./skills\\` directory with 4 skill definitions:\n- \\`feishu-doc\\`\n- \\`feishu-drive\\`\n- \\`feishu-perm\\`\n- \\`feishu-wiki\\`\n\nThis PR's patch removes the \\`\\\"skills\\\": [\\\"./skills\\\"]\\` entry from the manifest, which means those skills will **no longer be registered** when the feishu plugin loads.\n\n**The main branch still has this line.** You can verify:\n\\`\\`\\`bash\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/contents/extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json | jq '.content' | base64 -d\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n**Suggested fix:** Add back the \\`\\\"skills\\\": [\\\"./skills\\\"]\\` line in \\`extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json\\`.\n\nEvery other skills-carrying extension (\\`acpx\\`, \\`tavily\\`, \\`diffs\\`, \\`open-prose\\`) retains its skills entry — this removal appears accidental given the PR scope is documentation clarifications.\n\n---\n*Reported as part of OpenClaw community contribution tracking*