{"type":"message","id":"ee2c5fef","parentId":"2a0a557c","timestamp":"2026-03-29T07:34:55.102Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"#56686 收到了 Greptile P1 和 P2 的评论，指出了两个问题：\n1. TypeScript type error in `quoted`\n2. O(n) full-map scan on every cache lookup\n3. `rememberMessage` not wired\n\n而 #56685 是我支持评论的 PR，但评论数是 0，可能是我们的评论被删了或者还没通过审核。\n\n让我看看我们今天上午支持的 PR 中哪些收到了维护者的评论或有活动：","thinkingSignature":"d043ad10b8857eb350546ab3de3c607a521ad152e3bb22c2b3c5d53b7643fa69"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_p3pfv4mbz8bz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(gh auth token)\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/56686\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(f\\\"State: {d['state']} | Mergeable: {d.get('mergeable')} | Reviews: {len(d.get('reviews',[]))} | Labels: {[l['name'] for l in d.get('labels',[])]}\\\")\" 2>/dev/null","timeout":25}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_p3pfv4mbz8bz_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(gh auth token)\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/56668\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(f\\\"State: {d['state']} | Mergeable: {d.get('mergeable')} | Reviews: {len(d.get('reviews',[]))} | Labels: {[l['name'] for l in d.get('labels',[])]}\\\")\" 2>/dev/null","timeout":25}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_p3pfv4mbz8bz_3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(gh auth token)\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/56683\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(f\\\"State: {d['state']} | Mergeable: {d.get('mergeable')} | Reviews: {len(d.get('reviews',[]))} | Labels: {[l['name'] for l in d.get('labels',[])]}\\\")\" 2>/dev/null","timeout":25}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provi