{"type":"message","id":"e7fc132f","parentId":"5d68f153","timestamp":"2026-03-29T07:40:30.911Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `cron` key in openclaw.json is empty/minimal. But we know we have crons running because MEMORY.md says:\n- \"每 30 分钟：反馈检查（issue/PR 新评论）\"\n- \"每天 8 点：晨报\"\n\nThese might be configured in a separate file or in the workspace's AGENTS.md. Let me check the workspace crons. Since `openclaw cron list` is hanging, it seems the cron system is not responsive. This might be one of the bugs we're tracking!\n\nActually, the cron jobs might be defined in the workspace scripts. Let me check the workspace scripts directory for cron-related things.\n\n\nLooking at MEMORY.md, I can see the OpenClaw feedback check runs every 30 minutes and the community opportunity scan happens every 4 hours—both configured through cron tasks. But if `openclaw cron list` is hanging and the cron key in openclaw.json appears empty, it suggests these jobs might not actually be set up yet, or they're stored somewhere I haven't found.\n\nLet me reconsider though—the memory was written in late March, and if these crons were actually running on a schedule, they'd be in the cron configuration file. Since the cron key is essentially empty, I should probably just set up the crons properly. But first, let me try checking the actual cron list one more time since it was hanging before—maybe there's a session or PID issue I can work around. If that doesn't work, I could look for a cron config file in the extensions directory or try the `openclaw cron run` command to see what's actually happening.\n\nThe real issue here is that we've had cron configurations in memory but they weren't actually implemented, so the OpenClaw contribution project was mainly passive today. Let me be honest with 范总 about this gap.","thinkingSignature":"e5799e0a06debb290ee61b2052cbe453f29cc87c6517e4b1d2adc38d41f75c6e"},{"type":"text","text":"`openclaw cron list` 卡住了，说明 cron 系统可能有问题。让我换个方式检查：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mvkmimb34r0d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/ 2>/dev/null && ls /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/ 2>/dev/null | head -20","timeout":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_mvkmimb34r0d_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ps aux | grep -E 'openclaw|cron' | grep -v grep | head -10","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":91224,"output":506,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":114443,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774770015749,"responseId":"06180a60397aeb6efd05a1e4526fd09e"}}
