{"type":"message","id":"41fd68b2","parentId":"e4a97d01","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:00:47.069Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! The cron jobs are already configured:\n1. `57a448ff` - Every 30 minutes: OpenClaw feedback check (last ran: 15:40, next: 16:10) ✅\n2. `6f8bd6c8` - Every 1 hour: OpenClaw community scan (last ran: 14:54, next: 15:54) ✅\n\nSo the cron tasks are already set up! But the \"every 1 hour\" is less frequent than what Fan Zong wanted (every 3 hours). Also, the \"every\" field is `None` - it seems the schedule might not be parsed correctly. \n\nI see the issue now - the current setup runs hourly, but Fan Zong requested every 3 hours, and there's a third cron job at 9 AM that's failing. Let me look at what's causing those errors and adjust the frequency to match the requirements.","thinkingSignature":"6f5ef1a21d1dd5e875f0917cceed8a6ebc945d5790ea65b48df7aeff16693e77"},{"type":"text","text":"cron 任务其实**已经配好了**！我来确认一下：\n\n- ✅ `57a448ff`：每 30 分钟检查反馈（刚在 15:40 跑过，下次 16:10）\n- ✅ `6f8bd6c8`：每小时扫描社区（刚在 14:54 跑过，下次 15:54）\n\n**但有两个问题：**\n1. 社区扫描是**每小时**跑，不是范总要求的 3 小时\n2. 晚间收口和晨报汇报两个 cron 报 `error` 状态\n\n我来修正扫描频率为 3 小时：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_s27ouf68jaos_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\ndata = json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor job in data.get('jobs', []):\n    if job['id'] == '6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64':\n        print(json.dumps(job, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":83038,"output":447,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106198,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774771233982,"responseId":"06180f22eca775a86f50f73ef5dcefee"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c927f4e7","parentId":"41fd68b2","timestamp":"2026-03-29T08:00:47.175Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_s27ouf68jaos_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64\",\n  \"agentId\": \"xixi\",\n  \"name\": \"OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"createdAtMs\": 1774611992772,\n  \"updatedAtMs\": 1774768205607,\n  \"schedule\": {\n    \"kind\": \"every\",\n    \"everyMs\": 3600000,\n    \"anchorMs\": 1774611992772\n  },\n  \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n  \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n    \"message\": \"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（每小时主动执行）\\n\\n你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的主动侦查员。每 1 小时自动执行，不需要任何人催促。\\n\\n步骤：\\n1. gh api 查最近 90 分钟内更新的 open GitHub issues 和 PRs（过滤已 merge/已 close）\\n2. 重点找：regression、未确认 bug、usability gap、docs gap\\n3. 读每个候选详情，判断是否值得 action\\n4. 在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的当前优先级表格中确认未重复\\n\\n已覆盖项（勿重复）：\\n#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 #55153 #55137 #55466 #55458 #55479\\n\\n判断标准：\\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试并更新文件\\n- docs gap / usability gap → 更新文件并考虑发 issue/PR\\n- 已是热门/有人处理中 → 跳过\\n\\n交付：\\n- 有值得 action 的新发现 → 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n- 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\\n\\n禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息、禁止 git commit。\\n\\nCurrent time: $(date '+\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d \\\\%H:\\\\%M \\\\%Z')\",\n    \"model\": \"arkcode/glm-4.7\"\n  },\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\",\n    \"channel\": \"last\"\n  },\n  \"state\": {\n    \"nextRunAtMs\": 1774770875230,\n    \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774767275230,\n    \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n    \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n    \"lastDurationMs\": 930377,\n    \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"not-delivered\",\n    \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n    \"lastDelivered\": false,\n    \"runningAtMs\": 1774770875230\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":67,"aggregated":"{\n  \"id\": \"6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64\",\n  \"agentId\": \"xixi\",\n  \"name\": \"OpenClaw 社区机会扫描\",\n  \"enabled\