{"type":"message","id":"bfc1d88e","parentId":"d42dab55","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:21:43.408Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_89ka65txkpti_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# OpenClaw 项目跟踪\n\n> 最后更新：2026-03-29 08:00 UTC\n> 扫描周期：每小时 cron 自动执行\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-29 08:00 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-29 06:24 UTC → 08:00 UTC（过去 96 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：9 个（已排除已覆盖项和 PR）\n- **状态**：发现 2 个 Critical 级别问题，4 个 High 级别问题，2 个 Medium-High 级别问题，1 个 Medium 级别问题\n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P0 - Critical 问题\n\n**#56839** - [Bug]: WhatsApp gateway sends message to Telegram user ID interpreted as phone number during config recovery\n- **类型**：bug + privacy/data leak\n- **严重度**：Critical（隐私/数据泄露）\n- **root cause**：缺少 channel identifier validation，Telegram user ID 被当作 WhatsApp phone number\n- **影响**：消息被发送到无关的第三方，隐私和数据泄露\n- **可修性**：S（需要添加 channel identifier validation）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级，立即处理）\n\n**#56854** - [Bug]: Gateway crashes with uncaught exception when Discord health monitor triggers stale-socket restart\n- **类型**：regression + bug + crash\n- **严重度**：Critical（gateway process dies completely，所有 channels 都会断线）\n- **root cause**：abort handler 和 health-monitor restart 之间存在 race condition，maxAttempts=0 导致 reconnect 失败\n- **影响**：gateway 崩溃，所有 channels 断线\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 abort handler 和 reconnection logic）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#56868** - [Bug]: [Bug] acpx plugin verification fails on Windows with spaces in user profile path\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：High（blocks acpx/ACP code dispatch entirely）\n- **root cause**：binary path 没有被引号包裹，Windows 会从空格处 split\n- **影响**：所有用户名中有空格的 Windows 用户无法使用 acpx/ACP\n- **可修性**：S（添加引号即可）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56855** - ACP: shouldReplaceEnsuredSession causes infinite replace loop with acpx 0.3.1 (sessions spawn fails)\n- **类型**：regression + bug\n- **严重度**：High（sessions spawn 失败，出现无限循环）\n- **root cause**：acpx 0.3.1 使用 lazy-start，shouldReplaceEnsuredSession 将 status: dead 视为需要替换\n- **影响**：ACP sessions 无法初始化，无限循环\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 shouldReplaceEnsuredSession 的逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56853** - Bug: tools.alsoAllow not injected in Feishu channel sessions (gateway tool unavailable)\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：High（gateway tool 在 Feishu 中不可用）\n- **root cause**：Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑有问题\n- **影响**：Feishu sessions 中无法使用 gateway tool\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":14,"aggregated":"# OpenClaw 项目跟踪\n\n> 最后更新：2026-03-29 08:00 UTC\n> 扫描周期：每小时 cron 自动执行\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-29 08:00 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-29 06:24 UTC → 08:00 UTC（过去 96 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：9 个（已排除已覆盖项和 PR）\n- **状态**：发现 2 个 Critical 级别问题，4 个 High 级别问题，2 个 Medium-High 级别问题，1 个 Medium 级别问题\n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P0 - Critical 问题\n\n**#56839** - [Bug]: WhatsApp gateway sends message to Telegram user ID interpreted as phone number during config recovery\n- **类型**：bug + privacy/data leak\n- **严重度**：Critical（隐私/数据泄露）\n- **root cause**：缺少 channel identifier validation，Telegram user ID 被当作 WhatsApp phone number\n- **影响**：消息被发送到无关的第三方，隐私和数据泄露\n- **可修性**：S（需要添加 channel identifier validation）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级，立即处理）\n\n**#56854** - [Bug]: Gateway crashes with uncaught exception when Discord health monitor triggers stale-socket restart\n- **类型**：regression + bug + crash\n- **严重度**：Critical（gateway process dies completely，所有 channels 都会断线）\n- **root cause**：abort handler 和 health-monitor restart 之间存在 race condition，maxAttempts=0 导致 reconnect 失败\n- **影响**：gateway 崩溃，所有 channels 断线\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 abort handler 和 reconnection logic）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#56868** - [Bug]: [Bug] acpx plugin verification fails on Windows with spaces in user profile path\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：High（blocks acpx/ACP code dispatch entirely）\n- **root cause**：binary path 没有被引号包裹，Windows 会从空格处 split\n- **影响**：所有用户名中有空格的 Windows 用户无法使用 acpx/ACP\n- **可修性**：S（添加引号即可）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56855** - ACP: shouldReplaceEnsuredSession causes infinite replace loop with acpx 0.3.1 (sessions spawn fails)\n- **类型**：regression + bug\n- **严重度**：High（sessions spawn 失败，出现无限循环）\n- **root cause**：acpx 0.3.1 使用 lazy-start，shouldReplaceEnsuredSession 将 status: dead 视为需要替换\n- **影响**：ACP sessions 无法初始化，无限循环\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 shouldReplaceEnsuredSession 的逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56853** - Bug: tools.alsoAllow not injected in Feishu channel sessions (gateway tool unavailable)\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：High（gateway tool 在 Feishu 中不可用）\n- **root cause**：Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑有问题\n- **影响**：Feishu sessions 中无法使用 gateway tool\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774783303386}}
{"type":"message","id":"9d2c1066","parentId":"bfc1d88e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:22:00.774Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. xixi has been actively scanning and finding bugs. The xixi workspace has its own OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with detailed findings.\n\nThe key findings from xixi's scans include:\n- P0: #56839 (WhatsApp privacy leak), #56854 (Discord gateway crash)\n- P1: #56868 (Windows path issue), #56855 (ACP infinite loop), #56853 (Feishu tools.alsoAllow not injected)\n\nNow I should report to Fan Zong:\n1. xixi has been actively scanning - YES, 5 rounds today, found many P0/P1 bugs\n\n\n2. aoao hasn't been doing much yet, so the coordination between xixi and aoao needs improvement\n3. I need to update AGENTS.md and address the workspace synchronization issue where xixi's findings should be feeding into the main workspace's tracking","thinkingSignature":"64ad4f4b99551cca34202d81cf01096e3625544d6284246e757f93781d639e08"},{"type":"text","text":"xixi 有在主动找 bug。**xixi 有自己的独立 workspace**，xixi 的扫描结果写在那里。现在整理完整汇报：\n\n---\n\n**范总，回答你的两个问题：**\n\n**① xixi 有没有主动寻找 bug？有的。**\n\n从 cron 日志看，xixi 今天已执行 5 轮扫描（每小时自动），找到的关键问题：\n\n- **P0（Critical）**：\n  - #56839：WhatsApp 消息发错人（隐私泄露）\n  - #56854：Discord health-monitor 触发 gateway 崩溃（race condition）\n  - #56816：Gateway 频繁崩溃（maxReconnectAttempts=0）\n- **P1（High）**：\n  - #56763：OpenAI 兼容 endpoints 被破坏\n  - #56733：Gateway event loop frozen\n  - #56868：Windows 用户名带空格导致 acpx 失败\n  - #56855：ACP infinite replace loop\n  - #56853：Feishu tools.alsoAllow 未注入\n\nxixi 扫描结果记录在 xixi 独立 workspace：`/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`\n\n**② 按 AGENTS.md 新规范做一次简报：**\n\n```\n【xixi】今天执行了 5 轮社区扫描，发现了 #56839/#56854/#56816 等 Critical/P1 bug，记录在 xixi workspace\n【aoao】今天未主动行动（等待 xixi 提供可修候选）\n【main】完成了 cron 任务配置（反馈检查每30min + 社区扫描每3h），支持了 7 个社区 PR Approve 评论，在 #55008 发现了 skills entry 误删 bug 并发了提醒评论\n```\n\n**下一步**：xixi 找到的 #56853 是 Feishu 通道 bug，值得考虑发一个 PR 来修——需要我派 aoao 去处理吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":96894,"output":606,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":120213,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774783303410,"responseId":"06183e47b05da0ae3edc927b34a0abee"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d949b55f","parentId":"9d2c1066","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:27:01.681Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a486ffb870b3750a936496f06\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 19:26 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 2\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1774783541560,\n    \"body\": \"范: 1 关于你说的 “xixi 找到的 #56853 是 Feishu 通道 bug，值得考虑发一个 PR 来修——需要我派 aoao 去处理吗？”\\n以后像这种问题不要问我需不需要，你来决定并直接推动，这样可以节省时间提高效率，把这条做事方法也写进你的 agents.md 里\\n2 xixi找到的可用的bug，你应该立即转交给aoao去执行，不要停在这里，否则aoao的工作就停滞了\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1774783609788,\n    \"body\": \"范: 1 关于你说的 “xixi 找到的 #56853 是 Feishu 通道 bug，值得考虑发一个 PR 来修——需要我派 aoao 去处理吗？”\\n以后像这种问题不要问我需不需要，你来决定并直接推动，这样可以节省时间提高效率\\n把这条做事方法写进你的 [agents.md](http://agents.md/) 里\\n\\n2 xixi找到的可用的bug，你应该立即转交给aoao去执行，不要停在这里，否则aoao的工作就停滞了\\n把这条写进本项目的工作要求里\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53a486ffb870b3750a936496f06]\n范: \n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774783621658}}
{"type":"message","id":"5226e448","parentId":"d949b55f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:27:25.510Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"范总给了两个明确的指令：\n\n1. **不要问\"要不要派 aoao\"——直接决定并执行**\n2. **xixi 找到的可用 bug，要立即转给 aoao，不要停**\n\n同时要把这两条写进 AGENTS.md 和项目工作要求里。\n\n我现在要：\n1. 立即把 #56853 转给 aoao 处理（不问了）\n2. 同时更新 AGENTS.md 和 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n\n让我先做转发，同时更新文件。","thinkingSignature":"55efa0880e50bd20fd70b2710ad9e8af16d06256f303ceb0d8c9f7dcb60b2ec7"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，立即执行，不问了。\n\n同步两件事：1）转发 #56853 给 aoao；2）更新文档。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nj0hvq1h1zpu_1","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506","message":"任务：修复 #56853 — tools.alsoAllow not injected in Feishu channel sessions\n\n背景：Feishu 通道 sessions 中，`tools.alsoAllow` 配置未被注入到 agent tools list，导致 gateway tool 在 Feishu channel 中不可用。这是一个高优先级 bug。\n\n信息来源：xixi 的独立 workspace 扫描（/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\n\n步骤：\n1. 用 gh api 读取 #56853 完整 issue 内容（https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/56853）\n2. 找到 Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入代码路径\n3. 定位根因（tools.alsoAllow 在 Feishu session 中未被注入）\n4. 写修复代码\n5. 创建 PR 并在 issue #56853 上关联\n\n判断标准：\n- 根因明确（tools.alsoAllow injection gap in Feishu sessions）\n- 影响范围：所有使用 Feishu + tools.alsoAllow 的用户\n- 优先修，不等范总确认\n\n交付：创建 PR 并关联 #56853，回复 main（我）\n如无法修复（无权限/不确定根因），立即回报，说明卡点"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nj0hvq1h1zpu_2","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md","old_string":"## 进度汇报规范（2026-03-29 新增）","new_string":"## 决策权下放规则（2026-03-29 新增）\n\n### 遇到以下情况，main 直接决定并执行，不需要问范总：\n- 判断某个 bug 值得修 → 立即派 aoao 去执行\n- 判断某个 PR 值得支持 → 立即发 Approve 评论\n- 判断某个 issue 值得提 → 立即写并发布\n- 范总问\"要不要 XXX\" → 默认答案是\"已经在做了\"，除非有明显风险\n\n### xixi 发现可用 bug → 立即转给 aoao，不等待\nxixi 扫描到的可用候选，必须立即转发给 aoao 执行，不能停在这里等范总确认。\n\n## 进度汇报规范（2026-03-29 新增）"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":675,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":119823,"totalTokens":120578,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774783621681,"responseId":"06183f86fddf464f01632d59aae18ab6"}}
