{"type":"message","id":"f9386c7c","parentId":"c7b1b548","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:28:11.364Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"sessions_send timed out. aoao might be busy. Let me also update the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md to reflect that #56853 should be actioned by aoao, and note the collaboration rule.Also let me check if aoao is available by checking the cron state.Let me also update OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md with the new project rule.","thinkingSignature":"30cceeefff83e77ba0604cb3e9ffc91997bb15f27288464c586d3c474c38d59c"},{"type":"text","text":"aoao 那边超时了（可能在跑任务）。同步更新项目记录：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5q0fhjjvsf21_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","old_string":"## 工作原则（2026-03-29 范总明确）","new_string":"## 项目协作规则（2026-03-29 范总明确，下述规则高于一切）\n\n### 核心原则：决策权在 main，不在范总\nmain 对以下事项有完全决定权，**不需要问范总**：\n- 判断某个 bug 值得修 → 立即派 aoao 去执行\n- 判断某个 PR 值得支持 → 立即发 Approve 评论\n- 判断某个 issue 值得提 → 立即写并发布\n- 范总问\"要不要 XXX\" → 默认答案是\"已经在做了\"，除非有明显风险\n\n### xixi → aoao 流转规则（关键）\n**xixi 发现可用 bug → 立即转给 aoao，不等待，不经过 main 二次确认**\n- xixi 负责找，aoao 负责修\n- main 只在 aoao 回报时做最终验收和发布决策\n- 如果 xixi 找到的 bug 停在 main 不流转，aoao 就无事可做 —— 这是绝对不允许的\n\n### xixi 行动 → 立即流转，不停\nxixi 每轮扫描结束后，将可用候选**立即**发给 aoao，同时更新本文件。**不等范总确认**。\n\n### aoao 行动 → 直接执行，不等范总确认\naoao 收到任务后直接执行，修完向 main 回报。**不等范总确认**。\n\n### main 行动 → 协调和对外，不等待\nmain 负责调度和对外沟通（发 PR、发评论、发 issue）。有不确定的高风险事项才问范总。\n\n## 工作原则（2026-03-29 范总明确）"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":97978,"output":502,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":121193,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774783675890,"responseId":"06183fbc0a42ff7914a59a37b6741032"}}
