{"type":"message","id":"ccf01e66","parentId":"e920f43d","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:28:44.500Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see all the sessions! Let me analyze what each agent has been doing:\n\n**xixi** (扫描 agent):\n- Last scan (cron 6f8bd6c8): 18:54 - was checking for new items but returned NO_REPLY (no new findings in the 6-hour window)\n- Earlier xixi scan session (187d71cf): ran at 08:56, found #56668 (WS keepalive PR) and #56688 (TTS directive PR) as top actionable items\n\n**aoao** (复核/修复 agent):\n- Session (7aa0f524): Currently RUNNING! aoao is actively working on something - it was looking at tool-policy.ts and checking how tools are built for Feishu sessions vs webchat sessions. This means aoao has already been assigned a task and is working on it!\n\n\n- aoao is digging into the tool-policy.ts file to understand the difference in how tools are injected between Feishu and webchat sessions, particularly focusing on why the gateway tool is available in one but not the other.\n\nI'm realizing the workflow issue - xixi isn't directly routing findings to aoao, but rather the cron job itself triggers xixi's scan, which then feeds into the project management system. Looking back at the session history, aoao does have a task in progress and is actively investigating the tool injection discrepancy. My initial concern about the workflow gap might be misplaced - the system is actually functioning as intended.\n\nNow I need to clarify what aoao is actually working on since that message to aoao timed out. Let me check the OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md file to see if there's documentation about #56853 that would explain the current work.","thinkingSignature":"7ce774459617e6f3a1b64a213511905441c1d024f77f496efe6e878bc45bb915"},{"type":"text","text":"aoao 当前正在运行中（看 tool-policy.ts，说明已有任务在执行）。让我确认 aoao 是不是在处理 #56853：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1cxfvhz0cj88_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -c 2000 /root/.openclaw/agents/aoao/sessions/7aa0f524-f67d-48d9-8f40-bd2db6719e48.jsonl 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n    line=line.strip()\n    if not line: continue\n    try:\n        d=json.loads(line)\n        role=d.get('role','')\n        content=d.get('content','')\n        if isinstance(content, list):\n            for c in content:\n                if isinstance(c,dict) and c.get('type')=='text':\n                    print(f'[{role}] {c[\\\"text\\\"][:300]}')\n                elif isinstance(c,dict) and c.get('type')=='toolCall':\n                    print(f'[{role}] tool: {c[\\\"name\\\"]} | args: {str(c.get(\\\"arguments\\\",\\\"\\\"))[:100]}')\n        elif isinstance(content,str):\n            print(f'[{role}] {content[:200]}')\n    except: pass\n\" 2>/dev/null","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":65846,"output":655,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89214,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774783705134,"responseId":"06183fd9c7d3b24a74d16112f3d9fc65"}}
