{"type":"message","id":"8de254a3","parentId":"4902c3b7","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:28:55.686Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3vwv4mh81lc9_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级，立即处理）\n\n**#56854** - [Bug]: Gateway crashes with uncaught exception when Discord health monitor triggers stale-socket restart\n- **类型**：regression + bug + crash\n- **严重度**：Critical（gateway process dies completely，所有 channels 都会断线）\n- **root cause**：abort handler 和 health-monitor restart 之间存在 race condition，maxAttempts=0 导致 reconnect 失败\n--\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#56868** - [Bug]: [Bug] acpx plugin verification fails on Windows with spaces in user profile path\n- **类型**：bug\n--\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56855** - ACP: shouldReplaceEnsuredSession causes infinite replace loop with acpx 0.3.1 (sessions spawn fails)\n- **类型**：regression + bug\n- **严重度**：High（sessions spawn 失败，出现无限循环）\n- **root cause**：acpx 0.3.1 使用 lazy-start，shouldReplaceEnsuredSession 将 status: dead 视为需要替换\n--\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56853** - Bug: tools.alsoAllow not injected in Feishu channel sessions (gateway tool unavailable)\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：High（gateway tool 在 Feishu 中不可用）\n- **root cause**：Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑有问题\n- **影响**：Feishu sessions 中无法使用 gateway tool\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":13,"aggregated":"- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级，立即处理）\n\n**#56854** - [Bug]: Gateway crashes with uncaught exception when Discord health monitor triggers stale-socket restart\n- **类型**：regression + bug + crash\n- **严重度**：Critical（gateway process dies completely，所有 channels 都会断线）\n- **root cause**：abort handler 和 health-monitor restart 之间存在 race condition，maxAttempts=0 导致 reconnect 失败\n--\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#56868** - [Bug]: [Bug] acpx plugin verification fails on Windows with spaces in user profile path\n- **类型**：bug\n--\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56855** - ACP: shouldReplaceEnsuredSession causes infinite replace loop with acpx 0.3.1 (sessions spawn fails)\n- **类型**：regression + bug\n- **严重度**：High（sessions spawn 失败，出现无限循环）\n- **root cause**：acpx 0.3.1 使用 lazy-start，shouldReplaceEnsuredSession 将 status: dead 视为需要替换\n--\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#56853** - Bug: tools.alsoAllow not injected in Feishu channel sessions (gateway tool unavailable)\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：High（gateway tool 在 Feishu 中不可用）\n- **root cause**：Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑有问题\n- **影响**：Feishu sessions 中无法使用 gateway tool\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 Feishu channel sessions 的工具注入逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774783735664}}
