{"type":"message","id":"80cf280e","parentId":"3f06a6b6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:33:42.205Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"范总在问我\"通过什么规则来实现这个流程\"。我需要：\n\n1. 明确说明当前的流程问题\n2. 说明我打算怎么改\n3. 把这个规则写进 AGENTS.md 和项目文件\n\n当前问题：\n- xixi 的 cron 扫描（`6f8bd6c8`）是独立运行的 xixi agent session，扫描结果只写文件\n- xixi 不会主动把结果发给 aoao\n- 我（main）也没有在 xixi 扫描完成后主动流转\n\n解决方案：\n1. **方案A**：让 xixi 的 cron 任务消息里包含\"扫描完成后直接发给 aoao\"——但这需要修改 cron 任务的消息内容\n\n\n2. **方案B**：让 xixi 在扫描完成后，通过 sessions_send 发给 aoao——但 xixi 的 cron 任务消息没有这个指令\n3. **方案C**：xixi 写文件后，main 在下一次 heartbeat 或者某个触发点检查文件，发现新条目后发给 aoao——但这不够及时\n4. **方案D（最佳）**：修改 xixi 的 cron 任务消息，让 xixi 在扫描完成后直接通过 sessions_send 把可用 bug 发给 aoao——这样流程自动化了，不需要我介入\n\n现在需要更新 xixi 的 cron 任务消息，在其中加入\"扫描完成后立即发给 aoao\"的指令，同时在项目文件里记录这个新规则。","thinkingSignature":"d46ce0af07b77c60e7b7a6bfd2d380d1d701e7a22ef9bbc3289f3f36a6b5c153"},{"type":"text","text":"范总问的是规则本质。当前问题是：\n\n**xixi cron 扫描（`6f8bd6c8`）是独立运行的 session**，xixi 扫完后只写文件，不主动流转给 aoao。\n\n我来修复这个规则——让 xixi 在扫描完成后直接发 aoao：\n\n**方案：修改 xixi 的 cron 任务消息，加入 aoao 流转指令**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ukb278s2y8cz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('cron/jobs.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\nfor job in data['jobs']:\n    if job['id'] == '6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64':\n        print(job['payload']['message'][:500])\n        print('...')\n        print('Length:', len(job['payload']['message']))\n\" 2>/dev/null","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":529,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":67846,"totalTokens":91168,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774784003640,"responseId":"061841033525d64c933e740ff6e74544"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b00ac7bb","parentId":"80cf280e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:33:42.296Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ukb278s2y8cz_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（每3小时主动执行）\n\n你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的主动侦查员。每 3 小时自动执行，不需要任何人催促。\n\n步骤：\n1. gh api 查最近 6 小时内更新的 open GitHub issues 和 PRs（过滤已 merge/已 close）\n2. 重点找：regression、未确认 bug、usability gap、docs gap\n3. 读每个候选详情，判断是否值得 action\n4. 在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的当前优先级表格中确认未重复\n\n已覆盖项（勿重复）：\n#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 #55153 #55137 #55466 #55458 #55479\n\n判断标准：\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试并更新文件\n- docs gap / usability gap → 更新文件并考虑发 issue/PR\n- 已是热门/有人处理中 → 跳过\n\n交付：\n- 有值得 action 的新发现 → 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n- \n...\nLength: 597"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":46,"aggregated":"任务：扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会（每3小时主动执行）\n\n你是 OpenClaw 贡献项目的主动侦查员。每 3 小时自动执行，不需要任何人催促。\n\n步骤：\n1. gh api 查最近 6 小时内更新的 open GitHub issues 和 PRs（过滤已 merge/已 close）\n2. 重点找：regression、未确认 bug、usability gap、docs gap\n3. 读每个候选详情，判断是否值得 action\n4. 在 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 的当前优先级表格中确认未重复\n\n已覆盖项（勿重复）：\n#54952 #54964 #55008 #55013 #55153 #55137 #55466 #55458 #55479\n\n判断标准：\n- 能本地复现 + 严重度高 → 直接测试并更新文件\n- docs gap / usability gap → 更新文件并考虑发 issue/PR\n- 已是热门/有人处理中 → 跳过\n\n交付：\n- 有值得 action 的新发现 → 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n- \n...\nLength: 597","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774784022272}}
{"type":"message","id":"68a63f9d","parentId":"b00ac7bb","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:33:52.069Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to update the xixi cron message to include instructions to send actionable bugs directly to aoao. Let me update the cron job message to include aoao forwarding instructions.","thinkingSignature":"7522f08515a5aec50676acb046ef79a98531ac4b69ad4086f9134b40752d2702"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_to5a83u18eyo_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw && python3 << 'EOF'\nimport json\n\nwith open('cron/jobs.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n\nfor job in data['jobs']:\n    if job['id'] == '6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64':\n        old_msg = job['payload']['message']\n        \n        new_msg = old_msg.replace(\n            '交付：\\n- 有值得 action 的新发现 → 更新 memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n- 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\\n\\n禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息、禁止 git commit。',\n            '交付（必须按顺序执行）：\\n1. 有值得 action 的新发现 → 同时做两件事：\\n   a. 更新 /root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n   b. 立即 sessions_send 发给 aoao（agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506），说明 bug 详情、根因、可修性\\n2. 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\\n\\n**关键：发现可用 bug 时必须立即发给 aoao，不等 main 二次确认。**\\n\\n禁止向任何聊天渠道发消息、禁止 git commit。'\n        )\n        job['payload']['message'] = new_msg\n        print('New message preview:')\n        print(new_msg[-600:])\n        print('\\nDone')\n\nwith open('cron/jobs.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nEOF","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":68696,"output":442,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91851,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774784022300,"responseId":"061841166067f166f800957a983fce50"}}
