{"type":"message","id":"b187e555","parentId":"bb07c1f8","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:34:08.778Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me give a clear answer to 范总's question.","thinkingSignature":"5ccb510b0f37a3796bd859ee570b7a9f56be15c65687eb7da3d39108378b1c35"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n**回答你的问题：通过什么规则实现**\n\n核心就一条：**xixi 扫描完发现可用 bug → 立即 sessions_send 发给 aoao**，不在 main 这里中转。\n\n具体机制：\n\n```\nxixi cron（每3小时）\n    ↓\n扫描完成，发现 #56853 这类可用 bug\n    ↓\n同时做两件事：\n  a. 写 workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n  b. sessions_send → aoao（直接发，不过 main）\n    ↓\naoao 收到后直接执行，不等任何人确认\n    ↓\n修完回报 main → main 做最终验收和发布\n```\n\n**关键改变**：之前 xixi 只写文件，现在加了 `sessions_send 发给 aoao` 这一步。规则已写入 xixi cron 任务消息，下次扫描（21:54）就会按新规则执行。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":69883,"output":205,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92801,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774784041758,"responseId":"06184129578b32a163c7d2aeb6253eb7"}}
