{"type":"message","id":"0ebc85aa","parentId":"e1478664","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:37:15.889Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fan wants two changes:\n1. xixi should send bugs to main first, then main forwards to aoao (main needs to know what xixi is doing before forwarding)\n2. Change xixi's scan interval from 3 hours to 1 hour\n\nLet me update the xixi cron job message to reflect this new flow, and change the interval from 3 hours to 1 hour.","thinkingSignature":"ac3ca9ea728dc04be35865cd70dd7e1bc76adc9152a1028d54945c0869ffdb27"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，两个改动：1）xixi→main→aoao；2）扫描改回1小时。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vlnn5r3fqlub_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw && python3 << 'EOF'\nimport json\n\nwith open('cron/jobs.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n\nfor job in data['jobs']:\n    if job['id'] == '6f8bd6c8-5b5f-4cf7-8e6f-3479fd23fc64':\n        # Change interval from 3h to 1h\n        job['schedule']['everyMs'] = 3600000  # 1 hour in ms\n        job['schedule']['anchorMs'] = 0\n        \n        old_msg = job['payload']['message']\n        \n        new_msg = old_msg.replace(\n            '## xixi → aoao 流转规则（关键，已写入 cron 任务）\\n**xixi 发现可用 bug → 立即转给 aoao，不等待，不经过 main 二次确认**\\n\\n具体实现：\\n- xixi 的 cron 任务（`6f8bd6c8`）的消息已更新：发现可用 bug 时，**同时做两件事**：\\n  1. 写 workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n  2. **立即 sessions_send 发给 aoao**（`agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506`）\\n- aoao 收到后直接执行，修完回报 main\\n- main 只在 aoao 回报时做最终验收和发布决策\\n\\n禁止：xixi 找到 bug 后停在文件里不动，或等 main 转发。',\n            ''\n        )\n        \n        new_msg = new_msg.replace(\n            '交付（必须按顺序执行）：\\n1. 有值得 action 的新发现 → 同时做两件事：\\n   a. 更新 /root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n   b. 立即 sessions_send 发给 aoao（agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506），说明 bug 详情、根因、可修性\\n2. 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\\n\\n**关键：发现可用 bug 时必须立即发给 aoao，不等 main 二次确认。**',\n            '交付（必须按顺序执行）：\\n1. 有值得 action 的新发现 → 同时做两件事：\\n   a. 更新 /root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\\n   b. **立即 sessions_send 发给 main**（agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8），说明 bug 详情、根因、可修性\\n2. 无新发现 → 回复 NO_REPLY\\n\\n**关键：发现可用 bug 时必须发给 main，由 main 转发给 aoao。这样 main 才能知道 xixi 做了什么。**'\n        )\n        \n        new_msg = new_msg.replace('每3小时', '每1小时')\n        new_msg = new_msg.replace('每 3 小时', '每 1 小时')\n        new_msg = new_msg.replace('最近 6 小时内', '最近 2 小时内')\n        \n        job['payload']['message'] = new_msg\n        print('Interval: 1 hour')\n        print('Flow: xixi → main → aoao')\n        print('\\nMessage preview (last 400 chars):')\n        print(new_msg[-400:])\n\nwith open('cron/jobs.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('\\nDone')\nEOF","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":957,"cacheRead":91556,"cacheWrite":1180,"totalTokens":93773,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774784213126,"responseId":"061841d527216303bfa8db9daae2da6d"}}
