{"type":"message","id":"2616e33c","parentId":"49632c55","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:38:13.803Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now I need to add instructions for main on what to do when it receives a bug from xixi. I should add this to the AGENTS.md or create a handler in the PROJECT.md.\n\nActually, the \"main收到后\" steps are already written in the PROJECT.md file. The question is: when xixi sends to `agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8`, does the main agent automatically know to forward to aoao?\n\nThe answer is: the main agent will process the message in its main session (the Feishu group chat or direct chat with Fan). But it needs to know what to do with the message.\n\n\nThe current system prompt already has xixi's findings routed to the group chat where main is listening, so I need to make sure main has clear instructions on what action to take when it receives those findings—it should forward them to aoao rather than just acknowledge them.","thinkingSignature":"ec267625a0a765979068bae2e992dc18a7ed4ba445cc2bd0f1e92f5fa782eb63"},{"type":"text","text":"\n现在在 AGENTS.md 的 main 职责里加入收到 xixi 消息后的处理规则：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_u1yi6z5xxpfo_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md","old_string":"### xixi 行动 → 立即流转，不停\nxixi 每轮扫描结束后，将可用候选**立即**发给 aoao，同时更新本文件。**不等范总确认**。","new_string":"### xixi 行动 → 立即发给 main，不停\nxixi 每轮扫描结束后，将可用候选**发给 main**（不发 aoao）。main 收到后立即转发给 aoao。\n\n**main 收到 xixi 转来 bug 时的处理规则：**\n1. 读 xixi 的消息（包含 bug 详情、根因、可修性）\n2. 判断是否转发给 aoao（已在 AGENTS.md 下放决策权，默认转）\n3. sessions_send 转发给 aoao（`agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506`）\n4. 同时更新 /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\n5. **不做其他事，不等确认，立即执行**"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":74097,"output":505,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97315,"cost":{"input":0,"output"