{"type":"message","id":"7d2ecf81","parentId":"097ef452","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:38:36.151Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me summarize the changes for Fan.","thinkingSignature":"db8b66c7dc60d3b3301a046c002059042c2d748ba64c26c713ec9c1d137c3481"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n**已完成，两处改动：**\n\n**① xixi 扫描间隔：3小时 → 1小时**\n已更新 `cron/jobs.json`，xixi cron `6f8bd6c8` 下次执行周期变为每小时\n\n**② 流转规则：xixi → main → aoao**\n\n流程变成：\n```\nxixi cron（每1小时）\n    ↓ 发现可用 bug\n    → sessions_send → main\n         ↓ 收到立即转发\n    → sessions_send → aoao\n         ↓ 执行\n    → 回报 main → main 验收\n```\n\n**AGENTS.md** 和 **OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md** 已同步更新。\n\n范总问的\"通过什么规则实现\"——核心是：xixi cron 消息里写死了目标 sessionKey，main 收到后按 AGENTS.md 的规则立即转发。这个规则不需要你来触发，自动跑。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":75886,"output":203,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98802,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774784307926,"responseId":"061842344d2b9860914d7a892d3480fb"}}
