{"type":"message","id":"05298ca9","parentId":"337d9e3e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T11:40:12.293Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"范总说\"很棒，继续你们的工作！不能暂停本项目的任何工作，除非我说停止！\"\n\nThis is the confirmation and encouragement from Fan. I should:\n1. Acknowledge and confirm\n2. Make sure all the work continues - the cron jobs are running\n3. Check on aoao's progress with #56853\n\nLet me check the current status quickly and confirm to Fan.","thinkingSignature":"57a7a08c138ac7200a5e3de1510dfa2d3463fed0553864648b6511ddf6fb51f7"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！持续推进，工作原则已固化。\n\n快速确认一下当前状态：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0h8jol20opxg_1","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"kinds":["other"],"limit":5,"messageLimit":1}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0h8jol20opxg_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nfrom datetime import datetime\nwith open('cron/jobs.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\nfor job in data.get('jobs',[]):\n    s=job.get('state',{})\n    last=datetime.fromtimestamp(s.get('lastRunAtMs',0)/1000).strftime('%H:%M') if s.get('lastRunAtMs') else '?'\n    nxt=datetime.fromtimestamp(s.get('nextRunAtMs',0)/1000).strftime('%H:%M') if s.get('nextRunAtMs') else '?'\n    print(f'{job[\\\"name\\\"][:30]} | last:{last} | next:{nxt} | {s.get(\\\"lastRunStatus\\\",\\\"?\\\")}')\n\" 2>/dev/null","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80,"output":350,"cacheRead":22713,"cacheWrite":75373,"totalTokens":98516,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774784399889,"responseId":"061842904ffcc09a8a5c98aa9aca59bb"}}
